# Native AI reasoning experience (V1)

Before any completed-task or agent handoff, set:

```text
REASONING_DISTILLATION_REQUIRED=YES
```

Every completed task/handoff MUST write a `NATIVE_AI_REASONING_EXPERIENCE_V1`
export. Missing export => `INCOMPLETE_HANDOFF`.

Do **not** preserve raw private chain-of-thought. Distill evidence-based
reasoning only.

## Where to write

Live PACKAGE (authoritative):

```text
CANON_BLUEPRINT/_COORDINATION/reasoning/NATIVE_AI_REASONING_EXPERIENCE_V1.md
CANON_BLUEPRINT/_COORDINATION/prompts/New folder/NATIVE_AI_SHARED_REASONING_LESSONS.md
```

Also keep a per-run copy:

```text
CANON_BLUEPRINT/_COORDINATION/reasoning/NATIVE_AI_REASONING_EXPERIENCE_V1_<AGENT>_<RUN_ID>.md
CANON_BLUEPRINT/_COORDINATION/reasoning_exports/<UTC>_<AGENT>_<RUN_ID>.md
```

Append-only to the shared lessons file when a reusable pattern is found.
Do not delete old entries. Do not treat a recap as proof.

## Export schema (required fields)

```text
NATIVE_AI_REASONING_EXPERIENCE_V1
TASK_ID / RUN_ID
OWNER_AGENT
CURRENT_CLAIM
RUN_PROVENANCE
OBSERVATION
HYPOTHESES
HOW_TRACE
EVIDENCE_MATRIX
SUCCESS_VS_FAILURE
FIRST_DIVERGENCE
DECISIVE_TEST
ROOT_CAUSE_OR_UNKNOWN
REUSABLE_DECISION_PROCEDURE
STRUCTURAL_GUARD
BLAST_RADIUS
VERDICT_BY_LAYER
LESSON_TO_SHARE (or NONE)
NEXT_DECISIVE_EXPERIMENT
OWNER_AND_STOP_CONDITION
HANDOFF_STATUS (COMPLETE | INCOMPLETE_HANDOFF)
```

Classify claims: FACT / INFERENCE / HYPOTHESIS / SPECULATION / UNKNOWN /
CONTRADICTED. PASS labels must include evidence layer
(`PASS_XSIM`, `PASS_OOC`, `PASS_IMPLEMENTED`, `PASS_BOARD`, …).
No global `BOARD_PASS` / `FINAL_PASS` self-stamp.

